      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_17",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Rugnur",
            x: 16,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Glildur",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "ne",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("These elves are right behind me! We have to go warn the council of this attack...!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Alanin",
            text: _("Here — I’ll go warn the council. You stay here and fight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Yes, that sounds good. I’ll stay here and try to defend the gates..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Alanin",
            x: 31,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "changealanin",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Alanin",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Rugnur",
            x: 21,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glildur",
            text: _("I see you have sent a messenger to the city. Good idea, but will it really help? We have more troops and more provisions, and we are going to enter those caves and kill you!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Rugnur",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("(<i>Gulp</i>)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glildur",
            text: _("Ha! I thought as much. Well then, surrender!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Um... on what terms?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glildur",
            text: _("Unconditional."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_8",
            type: "Dwarvish Guardsman",
            side: 1,
            x: 9,
            y: 12,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_8",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_9",
            type: "Dwarvish Guardsman",
            side: 1,
            x: 13,
            y: 14,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_9",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_10",
            type: "Dwarvish Guardsman",
            side: 1,
            x: 11,
            y: 10,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_10",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_11",
            type: "Dwarvish Guardsman",
            side: 1,
            x: 14,
            y: 12,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_11",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Baglur",
            type: "Dwarvish Stalwart",
            side: 1,
            x: 21,
            y: 10,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Baglur",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Baglur",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Wait! Rugnur, dinna’ they tell you <i>anything</i> when you took command here?!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Not really. This was supposedly a time of peace. Who are you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Argh! I’m a retired warrior... it looks like I’ll ha’ to come out and help you, else we’ll be overrun by the damn elves... argh, again. Well, listen here. This entrance to the city can be closed. There’s a gate. If we can close it, the elves will no’ be able to enter. And you elves; begone from here!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glildur",
            text: _("Cease your meddling, old dwarf! Rugnur is in charge here, and it is he who will bargain with us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Baglur, how do you close the gates?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Och, well that’s the difficulty. It’s a magic gate. Indestructible. But that means it can only be closed by magic. Ye need to position a warrior on each of the six glyphs. When all are occupied, the gates wi’ close. Then the elves will be shut out of the caves forever, at least through this entrance."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Don’t we have troops positioned near these glyphs, to unlock them?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Och, well, no. Lately, trolls have been more in charge of those caves where the glyphs are than we dwarves have."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Well, where are they located?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Two are down a side passage in the northwest, another two are in a similar location in the southeast, and two are right next to the front gate."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Glildur",
            text: _("Have you made up your mind yet about surrendering? If you will not give up, prepare for battle!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("You may be more powerful than us, but I doubt even you can blast through dwarf-made stonecraft. We refuse — now let’s close these gates!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_18",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "2,22",
            y: "4,23",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("But what about this entrance? The elves can come through it just as easily as the main gate, and it cannot be closed!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("I think it can be sealed up somehow... yes, look, activating that glyph seems to have closed up the gap."),
          },
        ],
      },
